Use DataDict.pkg

Open OidcAuthorizationCode
Open OidcClient

Class cOidcAuthorizationCodeDataDictionary is a DataDictionary
    
    Procedure Construct_Object
        Forward Send Construct_Object
        Set Main_File to OidcAuthorizationCode.File_Number

        Set Add_Server_File to OidcClient.File_Number

        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_KEYFIELD DD_NOPUT to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_KEYFIELD DD_FINDREQ to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_INDEXFIELD DD_NOPUT to True
        Set Foreign_Field_Option DD_DEFAULT DD_DISPLAYONLY to True

    End_Procedure
    
    Procedure Creating
        Move (CurrentDateTime()) to OidcAuthorizationCode.CreatedAt
    End_Procedure
End_Class